0..75 Comment "//! `ZeroFiber` states an extension signature over the two points of `Two`."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..140 Comment "//! The signature fixes each `Val` cell to `zero` at `left`."
141..144 Comment "//!"
145..212 Comment "//! The checker applies its boundary, β and η laws by conversion."
213..216 Comment "//!"
217..288 Comment "//! - cites: [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]"
289..292 Comment "//!"
293..448 Comment "//! [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.05658 \"Zhang, Three non-cubical applications of extension types\""
